# Harness (mandatory)

This project uses `./harness.sh`. Cursor hooks auto-inject the session index and run `reflect` on stop.

You MUST still:
- Run `./harness.sh recall "<topic>"` before working on an unfamiliar area
- Run `./harness.sh learn --title "..." --fix "..."` immediately when tests, lint, or review catch a mistake
- Never re-derive lessons already stored in the harness

Skipping harness commands is not allowed. They are workflow infrastructure, not optional suggestions.
